 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLooking at the row echelon form, we see that $A$ has $3$ pivots, and therefore the number of pivot columns is $3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124885 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8394053e-1dfd-5bb2-b4f9-81664e19df78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121911} {:answer/id #uuid "f6384bfd-02e6-5535-8d51-062cffa80106" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121912} {:answer/id #uuid "0bb191f9-71b5-5740-93c2-a4d76bb498a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121913} {:answer/id #uuid "0ff1ae3e-6659-5834-92f8-db52d38bb2be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121914} {:answer/id #uuid "5c78fd13-39a0-526f-ab60-dc28debe3aa3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121915}] :answer-field/id #uuid "4332c4ac-d5dc-5086-844f-b1c234bed282" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121910}] :question/id #uuid "8a6c1395-93b3-574c-b784-2d33009b00c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-35459" :question/problem "Determine the number of pivot columns of the matrix $D$, given by\n$D = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & -8 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266022 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "68a8607f-a7ae-55fc-9873-e64beeb45e80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263901} {:answer/id #uuid "7e1d3e3e-0f30-5d5f-8356-38994faa850b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264088} {:answer/id #uuid "920e5f30-7863-597b-82f8-b218ad7f5cfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/va